# ── Generated output and library data ────────────────────────────────────────
# The apps write reports, exports and backups into the folder they are run
# from, so these land in the working tree on every use. They also carry real
# library data — a borrower leaderboard names patrons, and a master backup
# contains the whole member register — which must never be committed.
*.log
gdc_library.log
Book_Catalog_Export.csv
Missing_Books_Report.csv
GDC_Library_Master_Backup.xlsx
Library_Statistics_Report.pdf
GDC_Director_Summary.pdf
Leaderboard_*.pdf
Availability_Ratio.pdf
Top_Publishers_Chart.pdf
*_Report.pdf
*_Export.csv

# Local database and its SQLite journals
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Scratch and leftover patches
scratch/
*.patch
